{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>LiftLoggr 是一款專為重訓與健身訓練記錄而設的 App，適合想以最少操作記下每組訓練、掌握休息節奏與長期進度的人士。現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99，日後可能改為收費。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-65.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>單鍵記錄每組訓練</h2>\n<p>輕點圓圈即可記錄每組訓練，並以熱身清單與自動休息計時器掌握節奏，倒數、加時及跳過可直接在鎖定畫面操作。內置 499 個可按肌群與器材篩選的動作，支援自訂訓練範本、當日課表、完整歷史、月曆檢視、自動 PR 與估算 1RM；Apple Watch 可同步訓練並記錄心率、卡路里至 Apple Health，且完全離線可用。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-91-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-92-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-93-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-94-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-95-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-96-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：LiftLoggr</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/liftloggr/id6788341894?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:45:28.082242+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:48.041085+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:41.415982+00:00","content_hash":"467c01dd1e3c0456b4b3facae41256c324ac9c9106836fa721bef8e87a0d677e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}